    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῆ</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῆς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			3
		</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
			2
		</span></i> pers. sg. pres.
		indic. of a defect. verb, expld. by <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> and Sch.<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Ant.</u>
			887
		</span></i> by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέλει χρῄζει, θέλεις
		χρῄζεις</span> and found in the following passages: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε χρῇ θανεῖν</span> whether she <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>desires</i> to die, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				887
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρή</span> codd., cf. Sch.ad
			loc.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ δὲ δρᾶν ἔξεσθ᾽ ἃ χρῇς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1373
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρή</span> codd.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε χρῇς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρύσσειν με</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				606
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρή</span> codd.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ταῦθ᾽ ὅ τι χρῇ καὶ παλαμάσθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					918
				</span></i>
			 (anap., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρή</span> codd.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρα δ᾽ ἄλλ᾽ ὅ τι χρῇς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					127
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				4
			</span></i> (prob. l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ χρῆσθα</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνεῖν</span>); <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				778
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Megarian</span>). (Cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρή, κέχρημαι</span> 'I yearn after', <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῄζω.</span>)</div>
